  "behaviour": [
    "Refunds go through Paystack's refund API; full or partial, never more than was captured less earlier refunds.",
    "A paid wish that fails is refunded automatically (T-73) with reason delivery-failed; others need a finance or owner approval (the one who requests cannot approve).",
    "A refund reverses what it bought: a refunded ticket unseals the wish; a refunded keep removes those days; refunded credits are taken back if unspent.",
